"""Quick answers (questions.html): the questions people ask most about Welsh history, each answered in a few lines.

GROUPS is a list of sections; each has a list of Q(id, question EN, question CY, answer EN, answer CY, see).
`see` lists pages on the site to read more. Keep answers short, proud and plain (see EDITORIAL.md).
The page also carries FAQ data for search engines, so the English answer must stand on its own.
"""


def Q(id, qEn, qCy, aEn, aCy, see=()):
    return dict(id=id, qEn=qEn, qCy=qCy, aEn=aEn, aCy=aCy, see=list(see))


