    "Alun Michael (1999–2000, fel Prif Ysgrifennydd), Rhodri Morgan (2000–2009), Carwyn Jones (2009–2018), Mark Drakeford (2018–2024), Vaughan Gething (2024), Eluned Morgan (2024–2026) ac, ers 2026, Rhun ap Iorwerth o Blaid Cymru.",
